DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The nneeoo driver provides support for NeoMagic MagicMedia 256AV and 256ZX
     audio chips found in many laptops, and perhaps on some PCI cards.

FFIILLEESS
     The driver needs a firmware file, which is loaded on demand when the de‐
     vice is attached:

           /etc/firmware/neo-coefficients

SSEEEE AALLSSOO
     ac97(4), audio(4), intro(4), pci(4)

HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The nneeoo device driver appeared in OpenBSD 2.7.

BBUUGGSS
     This driver has some bugs because NeoMagic refuses to provide documenta‐
     tion, even though they are discontinuing their products.  At the time of
     contact, all persons working at the company were hiding behind their re‐
     ceptionist as if in a stage of siege.

